{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "f4a2432ee053d234834f4fcea23c92077d4b991b04a24cda01eb9042cf0df32c", "ja": "あの、仕掛け人さま、お仕事中にすみません。\n少しだけいいですか？", "zh": "那个，策划执行人先生，抱歉在工作时打扰您。\n可以请您借我一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "eae50fd703f7fe959baf31970db8a3ccbed7629926ef85bac237ad107051d4b5", "ja": "ん？　大丈夫だよエミリー。\nどうしたんだい？", "zh": "嗯？可以啊，艾蜜莉。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "da87d3012963213f49093d61b265eb6570a0efdf462acad766312d6c5530065d", "ja": "フレー！　フレー！　仕掛け人さまっ。", "zh": "耶～！耶～！策划执行人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "c03166336b2d283e8ba3b38828d0e209dd4209cf32aab955d885f7eac389f11c", "ja": "フレフレ仕掛け人さま！　がんばれがんばれ仕掛け人\nさま！　わぁぁ～～……っ。……はいっ！！", "zh": "耶～！耶～！策划执行人先生！\n加油！加油！策划执行人先生！哇啊啊～～结束！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5a2d02196f1b43598c9209e25ef8d18a2b5eaefe4697079b846b4c7428c5e730", "ja": "エミリー……？", "zh": "艾蜜莉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "87e0bd907d8dfbebde8a03d80211c00ed5c708b38aa704fd2ccbed2264ce842d", "ja": "私、この前、応援の玉房を持って舞台の上で助太刀娘を\nした時に、こういうことをやりたいと思ったのです！", "zh": "自从上次拿着加油用绒球，\n在舞台上担任声援少女后，我就很想这么做了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a6ff388dedf22c4113771ec54f63a4157a036a2291e4ce308daea64a28c5d81e", "ja": "ええと、つまり……ポンポンを持ってチアガールをした\n時に思ったことの話だな？", "zh": "呃，意思是……\n这是你拿着彩球当啦啦队时想到的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "68f24502a9c3e78eca63fe5c03efaa0722a88bcc6b366157babbe3d5fda5c779", "ja": "はい！　いつも私のために頑張ってくださる仕掛け人\nさまにも、ぜひこうして直接声援をお送りしたいって。", "zh": "是的！对于平常一直为了我努力的策划执行人先生，\n我想像这样直接帮您加油打气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "403d9efd02a8985c3bb966d63fd50ee24ecd4acc9c30991fc1fda298eead1501", "ja": "でも……、もしかしてご迷惑でしたか？　ひょっとして\n大和撫子として、はしたなかったでしょうか……。", "zh": "不过……难道我对您造成困扰了？\n还是说身为大和抚子，这样的表现很不得体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fb19e2b7014e365dca9963303abcbcd386310754d82b87a8fcbfaac763eda2e6", "ja": "いやいや、そんなことは全然ないよ。エミリーが\n応援してくれる気持ちは、すごく嬉しいし。", "zh": "不会不会，完全没那种事。\n艾蜜莉愿意帮我加油打气的心意，让我很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "fc9092cb9a7c56267c2dd5f64ea40200f5ab06ea01fb9d569714508e9fa3fd7a", "ja": "それはよかったです！　あ……Oh No！　仕掛け人\nさま、私、やはり失敗をしてしまったかもしれません！", "zh": "那就好！啊……Oh No！策划执行人先生，\n我好像还是失败了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "46ea577291bd1550af005fb4afcd3a2a2fe849613f50fc5e2ef1fa9221904eaa", "ja": "こ、今度は何が問題なんだ？", "zh": "这、这次是什么问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "36d4ba30483a26dfa546ae1a26d4f72cabd3e68322fbd25ac8f98048e666e2be", "ja": "あの、『フレーフレー』って、日本語でしょうか？\nもしや私、外来語を使ってしまったのでは……？", "zh": "请问，『耶～耶～』是日文吗？\n难不成我用了外来语……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "74729c7080863f3355795b096dc4c5249ef60f5cefe36aa6e53d193e1f483389", "ja": "うーん……。とりあえず、昔から日本中で使われて\nいる言葉だから、大丈夫じゃないか？", "zh": "唔……总之这是从以前就被日本人\n广为使用的字眼，应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "825ce713885c7333da78b931fb6b5e3772011bf54f8967356f44e645d193f1ac", "ja": "そうなんですか！　それなら良かったです！　では\n私、またいつでも仕掛け人さまを応援しますねっ♪", "zh": "这样啊！那就好！那么，我以后也会随时\n为策划执行人先生加油打气的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1015_p", "source_sha256": "55e9a47518d28a90f47b88d3b8afd3b4ab1baf9ba6a4b132b3b94a44d567e2b7", "ja": "（普段は俺がアイドルを応援する側だが、逆に応援され\nるのも新鮮だな。ありがとう、エミリー！）", "zh": "（平常都是我在替偶像加油打气，\n反过来被加油打气的感觉很新鲜呢。谢谢你，艾蜜莉！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fc94740dadb44b2a87e3468514c94e2061715ba7e400429e771de43c9cb79537", "ja": "（でもフレーフレーの語源は、ちゃんと調べておかない\nとな。万が一の時は、そっと伝えることに……）", "zh": "（不过「耶～耶～」的由来我还是得好好查清楚，\n等到将来有必要时才能悄悄告诉她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
